      "publisher": "arXiv",
      "abstract": "We study the large-depth behavior of residual networks whose weights are correlated across layers at initialization. Our results confirm and extend a conjecture of Marion et al.[2025], according to which correlated initializations should interpolate continuously between the Brownian stochastic diffe...",
      "year": 2026,
