          "targetDoi": "10.1007/s10851-019-00903-1",
          "snippet": "Interesting insights on ResNets have recently been presented in [18,8,24] from an ordinary/partial differential equation (ODE/PDE) point of view. ResNets are regarded as numerical schemes of differential equations.",
          "section": "introduction",
          "type": "mentioning"
