          "snippet": "We plan to incorporate them into our multilevel training framework in future work. In addition to the interpolation operator, the multilevel method also uses a restriction operator R l : R n l+1 → R n l , in order to transmit data, such as gradients, from level l + 1 to level l. As common in multgrid literature [20], we choose the restriction operator as R l := (I l ) T .",
